\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"2212\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is a <em>unit rate.</em> It tells us the line rises <em>vertically</em> by <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.162ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 500.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-11-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-11-Title\">2</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E11-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> units per unit of <em>horizontal</em> change. </p>\n<p>Note the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>If a line moves upward as we move from left to right (<span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.324ex\" height=\"2.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -863.1 1000.5 1152.1\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-12-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-12-Title\">\\nearrow</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E12-MJMAIN-2197\" d=\"M582 697Q582 701 591 710T605 720Q607 720 630 706T697 677T795 662Q830 662 863 670T914 686T934 694Q942 694 944 685Q944 680 936 663T921 615T913 545Q913 490 927 446T956 379T970 355Q970 351 961 342T947 332Q940 332 929 349Q874 436 874 541Q874 590 878 598L832 553Q787 508 673 395T482 204Q87 -191 83 -193Q77 -195 75 -195Q67 -195 61 -189T55 -174Q55 -170 56 -168Q58 -164 453 232Q707 487 777 557T847 628Q824 623 787 623Q689 623 599 679Q582 690 582 697Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E12-MJMAIN-2197\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>), its slope is <strong>positive</strong> because the line rises by a positive amount.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>If a line moves downward as we move from left to right (<span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.324ex\" height=\"2.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 1000.5 1152.1\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-13-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-13-Title\">\\searrow</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E13-MJMAIN-2198\" d=\"M55 675Q55 683 60 689T75 695Q77 695 83 693Q87 691 482 296Q532 246 605 174T717 62T799 -20T859 -80T878 -97Q874 -93 874 -41Q874 64 929 151Q940 168 947 168Q951 168 960 159T970 145Q970 143 956 121T928 54T913 -45Q913 -83 920 -114T936 -163T944 -185Q942 -194 934 -194Q932 -194 914 -186T864 -170T795 -162Q743 -162 698 -176T630 -205T605 -220Q601 -220 592 -211T582 -197Q582 -187 611 -170T691 -138T787 -123Q824 -123 847 -128Q848 -128 778 -57T453 268Q58 664 56 668Q55 670 55 675Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-2198\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>), its slope is <strong>negative</strong> because the line falls (meaning it rises by a negative amount).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n           \n                </div>        \n                    \n           